# Build context hygiene. Without this the context is ~10 GB and the upload to
# the daemon takes longer than the build.
#
# .harvest alone is 4 GB of downloaded MRF and NPPES payloads, and .next/dev is
# 5 GB of Turbopack cache. Neither belongs anywhere near an image.

.harvest
.next
node_modules
.git
.github
.claude
.vercel

# Never ship a credential. The build reads .env.local through a BuildKit
# secret mount instead, so it is present during `next build` and in no layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local scratch
uploads/*
!uploads/.gitkeep
*.log
.DS_Store
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.env.local.bak-*

# The whole docs tree, unconditionally. It is 18 MB of internal memos, and the
# only routes that read it are local developer tools that 404 in a deployed
# build (lib/local-tools.ts). An earlier version of this file excluded
# docs/reports while the Dockerfile copied docs/ in — two rules disagreeing
# about the same directory, which resolves differently depending on pattern
# order. Excluding all of it is the version with one answer.
docs
scripts/qa
ops/reports
*.md
